; Exercise 01-expressions (chapter 1).
;
; (define name value) gives a name to a value; chapter 3 explains it.
;
; Replace each #void with a Novelo expression for the formula in the
; comment above it. Write the formula itself, not its result: the point is
; the prefix notation. Then run: tutorial/check.sh 01-expressions

; 3 × 4 + 5
(define first-formula #void)

; (10 − 4) × (2 + 3)
(define second-formula #void)

; 2 + 3 × (8 − 6) − 1
(define third-formula #void)

; The minutes in a week: 7 days of 24 hours of 60 minutes.
(define minutes-in-a-week #void)
